# Progression architecture (pointer)

Full law: [`docs/docs/architecture/progression.md`](../../docs/docs/architecture/progression.md).

**Permanent decision:** soft **character level** + cumulative **XP**; curve
\(\Delta(L)=A L^{B}+C\) (catalog-tunable; max level ~50); server
`apply_xp_delta` only; **no XP loss on death**; XP ≠ ARC ≠ AC. Soft content
gates preferred over hard DPS walls. Sources: missions, mob kills (level-gap
multipliers), later discovery.
[Missions](../../docs/docs/architecture/missions.md),
[Mobs](../../docs/docs/architecture/mobs.md),
[Player death](../../docs/docs/architecture/player-death.md).

When changing XP grants, level curve, level gates, or HaloBand XP UI, read the
full doc first. Also listed in `AGENTS.md`.
